{"3197670": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Arcane Mayhem", "steam_appid": 3197670, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcane Mayhem</strong> is a fast-paced action roguelike packed with chaotic spell‑slinging combat. Unleash devastating magic, fuse elemental reactions, and carve through relentless swarms of monsters to prove your worth as a rising wizard. Build a deadly Loadout, grow your ever-expanding spellbook, and collect items and buffs to help you on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/f356aef1c01025d7e53b1b4a29c52c34.poster.avif?t=1786724126\" aria-label=\"Gameplay video\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/f356aef1c01025d7e53b1b4a29c52c34.webm?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/f356aef1c01025d7e53b1b4a29c52c34.mp4?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR ARSENAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fill your spellbook:</strong> Collect unique Spellcards throughout your runs to expand your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your loadout:</strong> Transform your playstyle by switching Loadouts, which define your spell slots, starting attributes, and unique innate traits. Equip any combination of spells that suits your style, and instantly test them in the playground before entering a real run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain Mastery:</strong> Using spells earns Mastery XP. Unlock new spells by mastering existing ones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/1bc1b6fb753bfc8f8c47c35edfc0399d.poster.avif?t=1786724126\" aria-label=\"Spellbook showcase\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/1bc1b6fb753bfc8f8c47c35edfc0399d.webm?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/1bc1b6fb753bfc8f8c47c35edfc0399d.mp4?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game and earn XP to level up and unlock rewards like spells, artifacts, and cosmetic items. Collect Arcane Crystals to permanently unlock new spells, artifacts, and loadouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/31611b3b050f49f69c15ac5d54b0b346.poster.avif?t=1786724126\" aria-label=\"Character customization\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/31611b3b050f49f69c15ac5d54b0b346.webm?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/31611b3b050f49f69c15ac5d54b0b346.mp4?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE REGIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through waves of enemies across multiple regions, each ending in a battle against its boss.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts &amp; Shards:</strong> Find powerful Artifacts that reshape your mechanics, or stack Stat Shards to boost Agility, Critical Power, Spell Haste, Vitality, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Drafting:</strong> You’re never locked to a single spell loadout. Swap spells mid‑run to handle new threats and visit the Shop for key upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Status Effect Synergy:</strong> Mix Fire, Frost, and Lightning to unleash powerful elemental reactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLANNED FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Mayhem is in active development. Coming soon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mayhem Levels:</strong> Push your skills to the limit with difficulty modifiers for increased challenge and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges:</strong> Beat gameplay challenges to unlock new artifacts and cosmetic items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Content:</strong> New regions, enemies, artifacts, spells, loadouts, challenges and more!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Arcane Mayhem</strong> is a fast-paced action roguelike packed with chaotic spell‑slinging combat. Unleash devastating magic, fuse elemental reactions, and carve through relentless swarms of monsters to prove your worth as a rising wizard. Build a deadly Loadout, grow your ever-expanding spellbook, and collect items and buffs to help you on your way.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/f356aef1c01025d7e53b1b4a29c52c34.poster.avif?t=1786724126\" aria-label=\"Gameplay video\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/f356aef1c01025d7e53b1b4a29c52c34.webm?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/f356aef1c01025d7e53b1b4a29c52c34.mp4?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >YOUR ARSENAL</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fill your spellbook:</strong> Collect unique Spellcards throughout your runs to expand your collection.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Choose your loadout:</strong> Transform your playstyle by switching Loadouts, which define your spell slots, starting attributes, and unique innate traits. Equip any combination of spells that suits your style, and instantly test them in the playground before entering a real run.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Gain Mastery:</strong> Using spells earns Mastery XP. Unlock new spells by mastering existing ones.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/1bc1b6fb753bfc8f8c47c35edfc0399d.poster.avif?t=1786724126\" aria-label=\"Spellbook showcase\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/1bc1b6fb753bfc8f8c47c35edfc0399d.webm?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/1bc1b6fb753bfc8f8c47c35edfc0399d.mp4?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PROGRESSION</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Play the game and earn XP to level up and unlock rewards like spells, artifacts, and cosmetic items. Collect Arcane Crystals to permanently unlock new spells, artifacts, and loadouts.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/31611b3b050f49f69c15ac5d54b0b346.poster.avif?t=1786724126\" aria-label=\"Character customization\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/31611b3b050f49f69c15ac5d54b0b346.webm?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/extras/31611b3b050f49f69c15ac5d54b0b346.mp4?t=1786724126\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >CONQUER THE REGIONS</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Fight through waves of enemies across multiple regions, each ending in a battle against its boss.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Artifacts &amp; Shards:</strong> Find powerful Artifacts that reshape your mechanics, or stack Stat Shards to boost Agility, Critical Power, Spell Haste, Vitality, and more.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Tactical Drafting:</strong> You’re never locked to a single spell loadout. Swap spells mid‑run to handle new threats and visit the Shop for key upgrades.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Status Effect Synergy:</strong> Mix Fire, Frost, and Lightning to unleash powerful elemental reactions.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >PLANNED FEATURES</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Arcane Mayhem is in active development. Coming soon:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Mayhem Levels:</strong> Push your skills to the limit with difficulty modifiers for increased challenge and rewards.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Challenges:</strong> Beat gameplay challenges to unlock new artifacts and cosmetic items.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>New Content:</strong> New regions, enemies, artifacts, spells, loadouts, challenges and more!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Master the arcane in this fast-paced action roguelike. Grow your spellbook, draft your loadout, and trigger chaotic elemental reactions as you blast through relentless waves of enemies.", "supported_languages": "English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/ce90977b68d007b774915fe13343d791ab2c6fc3/header.jpg?t=1786724126", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/b905da635629a1814c7dfaa9d6a4c160a6eb618e/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1786724126", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3197670/b905da635629a1814c7dfaa9d6a4c160a6eb618e/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1786724126", "website": null, "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i3-6100 / AMD FX-6300<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 4 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 750 Ti / AMD Radeon R7 260X<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 10/11 (64-bit)<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-8400 / AMD Ryzen 5 1600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 / AMD Radeon RX 580<br></li><li><strong>DirectX:</strong> Version 11<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 2 GB available space<br></li><li><strong>Sound Card:</strong> DirectX compatible</li></ul>"}, "mac_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>", "recommended": "<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"}, "linux_requirements": {"minimum": "<stro